---
/**
 * DispatchBoardStory.astro
 * Canonical Mobile Companion to Web-Style Dispatch Board & Staging Operations
 * Blueprint Traceability: MOB-US-020..025, MOB-US-057..061 (MOBILE-EPIC-03 & 09)
 * Canonical Persona: Carlos Mendoza · Jefe de Patio Almacén & Coordinador de Muelle
 * Canonical Carrier: Diego Morales · Conductor Flota C-250 (Placa WKN-892)
 * Canonical Dispatches: DSP-204, DSP-198, DSP-191, DSP-183, DSP-176
 */
---

<div class="story-screen-container" id="story-despacho">
  
  <!-- Web-Style Documentation Heading -->
  <header class="section-heading-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-index">03</span>
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">CANDIDATE BOARD & STAGING · BLUEPRINT MOBILE-EPIC-03 & 09</p>
        <h2>Carlos Mendoza — Tablero Móvil de Despachos, Estiba en Muelle 3 y Custodia</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
          Acompañante móvil 1:1 del <strong>Dispatch Board</strong> de Web-Style. Diseñado para terminales Android industriales en patio y muelle de carga refrigerada. Permite monitorear las columnas operacionales (<code>Orders (4)</code>, <code>Ready / preparation (3)</code>, <code>In distribution (5)</code>, <code>Delivered (18)</code>, <code>Exception / returned (1)</code>), asignar conductor y vehículo, verificar bultos en rampa de salida con escaneo en ráfaga y emitir el token criptográfico HMAC-SHA256 en código QR dinámico para traspaso de custodia legal.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Meta Chips -->
    <div class="heading-meta-chips">
      <span class="doc-chip tone-info"><i class="pi pi-send" aria-hidden="true"></i> Muelle 3 Staging Frigorífico</span>
      <span class="doc-chip tone-neutral"><i class="pi pi-user" aria-hidden="true"></i> Carlos Mendoza · Jefe de Patio</span>
      <span class="doc-chip tone-info"><i class="pi pi-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i> Diego Morales · Flota C-250 (WKN-892)</span>
      <span class="doc-chip tone-success"><i class="pi pi-qrcode" aria-hidden="true"></i> Token HMAC-SHA256 Dinámico</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Interactive Story Workbench: 2-Column Responsive Layout -->
  <div class="story-workbench-layout">
    
    <!-- Left: Step Flow & Functional Blueprint Details -->
    <div class="story-details-col">
      
      <!-- Phase Navigation Bar -->
      <nav class="phase-selector-bar" role="tablist" aria-label="Fases de Despacho y Staging">
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn active" data-phase="board">
          <span class="phase-badge">01</span>
          <span>Tablero de Columnas</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="staging">
          <span class="phase-badge">02</span>
          <span>Muelle 3 & Chofer</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="tally">
          <span class="phase-badge">03</span>
          <span>Chequeo de Bultos</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="qr">
          <span class="phase-badge">04</span>
          <span>QR Criptográfico</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="phase-btn" data-phase="code">
          <span class="phase-badge">05</span>
          <span>Código Compose</span>
        </button>
      </nav>

      <!-- Phase 1: Candidate Board Columns -->
      <div class="phase-panel active" id="panel-phase-board">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 01</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">DISPATCH-BOARD · 5 KANBAN COLUMNS</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Columnas Operacionales del Tablero de Despachos</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Sincronización exacta con las 5 columnas canónicas de <code>web-style</code>. En pantallas móviles, las tarjetas se apilan con jerarquía táctil accesible y chips semánticos de estado.
          </p>
          
          <div class="columns-mini-board">
            <div class="board-column-summary">
              <div class="col-head">
                <strong>Orders</strong>
                <span class="badge-count">4</span>
              </div>
              <div class="col-card-preview">
                <span class="mono-dispatch">DSP-204</span>
                <strong>La Cava Fría</strong>
                <small>Lima · North</small>
                <span class="chip-status tone-info">Ready for review</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="board-column-summary">
              <div class="col-head">
                <strong>Ready / prep</strong>
                <span class="badge-count">3</span>
              </div>
              <div class="col-card-preview">
                <span class="mono-dispatch">DSP-198</span>
                <strong>Andino Food Service</strong>
                <small>Callao · Hub</small>
                <span class="chip-status tone-warning">Documents pending</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="board-column-summary">
              <div class="col-head">
                <strong>In distribution</strong>
                <span class="badge-count">5</span>
              </div>
              <div class="col-card-preview">
                <span class="mono-dispatch">DSP-191</span>
                <strong>Frío Norte SAC</strong>
                <small>Chiclayo · Route</small>
                <span class="chip-status tone-danger">Critical exception</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="board-column-summary">
              <div class="col-head">
                <strong>Delivered</strong>
                <span class="badge-count">18</span>
              </div>
              <div class="col-card-preview">
                <span class="mono-dispatch">DSP-183</span>
                <strong>Mercado Central</strong>
                <small>Lima · South</small>
                <span class="chip-status tone-success">Completed</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="board-column-summary">
              <div class="col-head">
                <strong>Exception</strong>
                <span class="badge-count">1</span>
              </div>
              <div class="col-card-preview">
                <span class="mono-dispatch">DSP-176</span>
                <strong>Distribuciones Sur</strong>
                <small>Arequipa · Hub</small>
                <span class="chip-status tone-danger">Blocked</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2: Muelle 3 Staging & Carrier Assignment -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-staging">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 02</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">STAGING MUELLE 3 · CARRIER ASSIGNMENT</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Asignación de Transportista y Muelle Frigorífico</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Carlos Mendoza vincula la orden <code>DSP-204</code> a la rampa de frío asignada verificando que el furgón cumpla con el pre-enfriado obligatorio a 2.0°C antes de iniciar la estiba.
          </p>
          <div class="evidence-grid">
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-user text-primary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Conductor Asignado</strong>
                <p>Diego Morales (Licencia A-IIIb Profesional)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-truck text-primary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Vehículo Flota C-250</strong>
                <p>Placa WKN-892 (Furgón refrigerado ThermoKing V-500)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-building text-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Muelle de Carga</strong>
                <p>Muelle 3 (Rampa Frigorífica Hermética)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-clock text-neutral" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Hora Salida Comprometida</strong>
                <p>10:45 AM (Restan 25 min para cierre de muelle)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3: Burst Scanning Tally -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-tally">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 03</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">RAMP CHECKLIST · BURST SCANNING GS1-128</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Chequeo Bulto a Bulto en Rampa de Salida</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Cada palet y caja master cruza el haz de escaneo CameraX en ráfaga. Si un palet de otro despacho ingresa al camión, el sistema emite un pitido audible y bloquea la emisión de la guía.
          </p>
          <div class="tally-progress-spec">
            <div class="tally-header">
              <strong>Progreso de Carga en Vehículo</strong>
              <span class="text-primary font-bold">2 de 3 Bultos Validados</span>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-bar-track">
              <div class="progress-bar-fill" style="width: 66%;"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 4: Dynamic Cryptographic QR Handoff -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-qr">
        <article class="evidence-card">
          <div class="card-kicker-row">
            <span class="card-step-badge">FASE 04</span>
            <span class="card-mono-id">HMAC-SHA256 · DYNAMIC QR HANDOFF</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Traspaso Criptográfico de Responsabilidad Legal</h3>
          <p class="card-desc">
            Al completar la carga, la app del Jefe de Patio genera un QR dinámico con un token <code>HMAC-SHA256</code> firmado digitalmente. El conductor Diego Morales lo escanea desde su app para certificar que asume la custodia legal y térmica de la mercadería.
          </p>
          <div class="evidence-grid">
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-lock text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Algoritmo Criptográfico</strong>
                <code>HMAC-SHA256 (Secret de Terminal Muelle 3)</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="evidence-item">
              <i class="pi pi-hourglass text-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <div>
                <strong>Ventana de Validez</strong>
                <p>15 Minutos (Regeneración automática anti-captura)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 5: Compose Code -->
      <div class="phase-panel" id="panel-phase-code">
        <section class="compose-code-container">
          <div class="code-card-header">
            <div class="code-title-group">
              <i class="pi pi-android" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span class="code-tag">Android Jetpack Compose · Material 3</span>
            </div>
            <span class="code-path">:apps:operations-android/dispatch/DispatchHandoffScreen.kt</span>
          </div>
          <pre class="compose-code"><code><span class="kw">@Composable</span>
<span class="kw">fun</span> <span class="fn">DispatchHandoffScreen</span>(
    dispatchId: <span class="type">String</span>, <span class="cmt">// "DSP-204"</span>
    driverName: <span class="type">String</span>, <span class="cmt">// "Diego Morales"</span>
    vehiclePlate: <span class="type">String</span>, <span class="cmt">// "WKN-892"</span>
    dockId: <span class="type">String</span>, <span class="cmt">// "Muelle 3"</span>
    tokenQrData: <span class="type">String</span>, <span class="cmt">// HMAC-SHA256</span>
    onCompleteHandoff: () -&gt; <span class="type">Unit</span>,
    modifier: <span class="type">Modifier</span> = <span class="type">Modifier</span>
) &#123;
    <span class="type">Column</span>(
        modifier = modifier.<span class="fn">fillMaxSize</span>().<span class="fn">padding</span>(<span class="num">16</span>.dp),
        verticalArrangement = <span class="type">Arrangement</span>.<span class="fn">spacedBy</span>(<span class="num">16</span>.dp),
        horizontalAlignment = <span class="type">Alignment</span>.CenterHorizontally
    ) &#123;
        <span class="type">DockHeaderInfoCard</span>(
            dock = dockId,
            dispatch = dispatchId,
            carrier = <span class="str">"$driverName · $vehiclePlate"</span>
        )
        <span class="type">DynamicHandoffQrCode</span>(
            payload = tokenQrData,
            modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.<span class="fn">size</span>(<span class="num">200</span>.dp),
            contentDescription = <span class="str">"QR de Traspaso de Custodia"</span>
        )
        <span class="type">Button</span>(
            onClick = onCompleteHandoff,
            modifier = <span class="type">Modifier</span>.<span class="fn">fillMaxWidth</span>().<span class="fn">height</span>(<span class="num">56</span>.dp)
        ) &#123;
            <span class="type">Text</span>(<span class="str">"Confirmar Salida de Muelle 3"</span>)
        &#125;
    &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
        </section>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right: Smartphone Hardware Simulator Preview -->
    <div class="story-preview-col">
      <div class="device-chassis-shell">
        
        <!-- Status Bar -->
        <div class="android-status-bar">
          <span class="status-clock">10:30</span>
          <div class="status-icons-cluster">
            <span class="conn-tag">5G</span>
            <i class="pi pi-wifi" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="battery-pct">91%</span>
            <i class="pi pi-bolt battery-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Compose Viewport -->
        <div class="compose-screen-viewport">
          
          <!-- Top App Bar -->
          <div class="compose-top-app-bar">
            <button type="button" class="btn-app-icon" title="Volver al tablero">
              <i class="pi pi-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="appbar-title-block">
              <span class="appbar-headline">Muelle 3 · DSP-204</span>
              <span class="appbar-sub">La Cava Fría · Estiba en Vehículo</span>
            </div>
            <span class="status-sync-chip" title="Staging sincronizado">
              <i class="pi pi-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Scrollable Content -->
          <div class="compose-scroll-content">
            
            <!-- Carrier & Vehicle Assignment Card -->
            <div class="compose-card carrier-assignment-card">
              <div class="card-header-line">
                <span class="order-tag">DESPACHO DSP-204</span>
                <span class="cold-chip"><i class="pi pi-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i> Flota C-250</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="buyer-heading">Diego Morales (Placa WKN-892)</h4>
              <p class="destination-line">
                <i class="pi pi-map-marker" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Destino: La Cava Fría · Av. Industrial 402 (Lima Norte)
              </p>
              <div class="thermo-precheck-row">
                <span class="thermo-status-dot"></span>
                <span>Pre-enfriado furgón verificado: <b>2.4°C</b> (Conforme)</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Staging Progress Card -->
            <div class="compose-card staging-tally-card">
              <div class="stepper-header-line">
                <span class="card-subhead">CHEQUEO DE ESTIBA EN RAMPA:</span>
                <span class="stepper-kg-total">2 de 3 Verificados</span>
              </div>

              <div class="progress-bar-track">
                <div class="progress-bar-fill" style="width: 66%;"></div>
              </div>

              <!-- Staging Checklist Items -->
              <div class="staging-items-list">
                <div class="staging-check-item verified">
                  <i class="pi pi-check-circle check-icon ok" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                  <div class="check-meta">
                    <strong>16x Salmón Salar Congelado 4-5kg</strong>
                    <span>Palet #PLT-9810 · Lote L-20260914-A · 10:24 AM</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="staging-check-item verified">
                  <i class="pi pi-check-circle check-icon ok" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                  <div class="check-meta">
                    <strong>8x Merluza Austral Filete 10kg</strong>
                    <span>Palet #PLT-9811 · Lote L-20260918-B · 10:26 AM</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="staging-check-item pending">
                  <i class="pi pi-clock check-icon wait" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                  <div class="check-meta">
                    <strong>Caja Termómetro Registrador Datalogger</strong>
                    <span>Sensor USB #LOG-881 · Pendiente de lectura en rampa</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dynamic HMAC-SHA256 QR Handoff Card -->
            <div class="compose-card qr-handoff-card">
              <span class="card-subhead">QR TRASPASO DE CUSTODIA (HMAC-SHA256):</span>
              <div class="qr-code-frame">
                <!-- SVG Vector QR Mock -->
                <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="qr-svg-mock">
                  <rect x="5" y="5" width="26" height="26" fill="#082846" rx="4"/>
                  <rect x="9" y="9" width="18" height="18" fill="#ffffff" rx="2"/>
                  <rect x="13" y="13" width="10" height="10" fill="#082846" rx="1"/>

                  <rect x="69" y="5" width="26" height="26" fill="#082846" rx="4"/>
                  <rect x="73" y="9" width="18" height="18" fill="#ffffff" rx="2"/>
                  <rect x="77" y="13" width="10" height="10" fill="#082846" rx="1"/>

                  <rect x="5" y="69" width="26" height="26" fill="#082846" rx="4"/>
                  <rect x="9" y="73" width="18" height="18" fill="#ffffff" rx="2"/>
                  <rect x="13" y="77" width="10" height="10" fill="#082846" rx="1"/>

                  <!-- Data Matrix dots -->
                  <circle cx="45" cy="18" r="3" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
                  <circle cx="55" cy="18" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="45" cy="30" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="55" cy="30" r="3" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
                  <circle cx="18" cy="45" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="30" cy="45" r="3" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
                  <circle cx="45" cy="45" r="4" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="55" cy="45" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="68" cy="45" r="3" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
                  <circle cx="82" cy="45" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="45" cy="60" r="3" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
                  <circle cx="55" cy="60" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="45" cy="75" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="55" cy="75" r="3" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
                  <circle cx="68" cy="75" r="3" fill="#082846"/>
                  <circle cx="82" cy="75" r="3" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="qr-crypto-meta">
                <span class="qr-hash-preview">HMAC-SHA256: 7f8b92c4...e14a</span>
                <small class="qr-timer"><i class="pi pi-hourglass" aria-hidden="true"></i> Token efímero · Expira en 14:32 min</small>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Complete Handoff Button (56dp target) -->
            <button type="button" class="btn-glove-confirm">
              <i class="pi pi-check-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Autorizar Salida de Muelle 3 (Emitir Guía)</span>
            </button>

          </div>

          <!-- Bottom Navigation -->
          <div class="compose-bottom-nav">
            <div class="bnav-tab active">
              <i class="pi pi-inbox" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Muelle 3</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bnav-tab">
              <i class="pi pi-send" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Despachos</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bnav-tab">
              <i class="pi pi-users" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>Flota</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bnav-tab">
              <i class="pi pi-chart-bar" aria-hidden="true"></i>
              <span>KPI Patio</span>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="android-gesture-pill"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .story-screen-container {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--nexa-space-6, 24px);
  }

  .section-heading-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
  }

  .section-heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 38px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--nexa-space-3, 12px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .section-index {
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-600, #2563eb);
    font: 700 var(--nexa-font-size-sm, 14px) / 1.4 var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
  }

  .section-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--nexa-color-primary-700, #1d4ed8);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .section-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 800 clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px) / 1.16 var(--nexa-font-family-display, sans-serif);
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-primary, #0f172a);
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--nexa-color-text-secondary, #64748b);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .heading-meta-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .doc-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .doc-chip.tone-info { background: #eff6ff; color: #1e40af; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; }
  .doc-chip.tone-neutral { background: #f8fafc; color: #334155; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .doc-chip.tone-success { background: #ecfdf5; color: #065f46; border: 1px solid #a7f3d0; }

  .story-workbench-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 390px;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .story-workbench-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .story-details-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .phase-selector-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--nexa-color-border-structural, #e2e8f0);
    padding: 6px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .phase-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #475569;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .phase-badge {
    font-family: var(--nexa-font-family-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    opacity: 0.7;
